From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antheas Kapenekakis <git@antheas.dev>
Date: Sat, 8 Nov 2025 19:05:02 +0100
Subject: feat: add support for running concurrently with Handheld Daemon

Add passthrough for TDP limit to handheld daemon. Then, if Handheld
Daemon is active, disable CPU/GPU/battery conservation features in
SteamOS Manager to avoid conflicts. If Handheld Daemon is inactive,
SteamOS Manager will manage power features as before.

In addition, re-use the conflict detection of Decky plugins from
handheld daemon to disable power features if they are detected.
